				<r3d:description language="eng">Population Data BC (PopData) is a multi-university, data and education resource facilitating interdisciplinary research on the determinants of human health, well-being and development.
Providing a range of services to researchers and data providers, PopData strives to ensure that researchers have timely access to the data and training they need to address research questions on population health. Research using these data informs policy-making and leads to healthier communities.</r3d:description>
